{
  "gaps": [
    {
      "id": "subagent-model-routing",
      "description": "为委派子代理选择与父级不同的模型路由，按调用传参或按角色配置行驱动。上游为每个角色规定模型与推理档，评审与竞赛流程依赖多席位模型多样性与跨厂商评判，历史挖掘依赖快而便宜的模型；标准模式未配置的会话里，子代理显式模型选择被限制为父级当前路由，选择其他路由被运行时拒绝，路由发现也只列出父级路由。",
      "sources": [
        "dsh.md",
        "dsh-evidence.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/playbooks/refactoring.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/playbooks/perf-issue.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/playbooks/bug-fix.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/playbooks/feature.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/playbooks/hillclimb.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/playbooks/eval.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/playbooks/runtime-forensics.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/playbooks/session-pickup.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/playbooks/trace-forensics.md",
        "pstack/skills/arena/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/skills/swarm/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/skills/interrogate/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/skills/recall/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/skills/show-me-your-work/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/skills/automate-me/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/skills/blast-radius/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/skills/no-comments/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/skills/setup-pstack/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/agents/poteto-agent.md",
        "pstack/docs/guide/01-setup.md",
        "pstack/docs/guide/04-design.md"
      ],
      "evidence": "dsh.md Models 行只断言参数机制。运行时核验（分层）：dsh-web-app/presets/{standard,cordis,ptc}.patch.yml 对 tool-subagent 设 modelSelection/modelDiscovery: true，dsh-tool-subagent/src/index.ts L246-260 据此在工具 schema 展开 provider/model/reasoning_effort；但同一文件 L74 注明 \"the tool remains model-visible so runtime policy owns rejection\"，dsh-tool-subagent/src/model-selection-settings.ts L1 \"Host-owned opt-in setting\"、L25 \"the shipped composition defaults it off\"（enabled 默认 false、allowedModels 默认 []），未记录策略时 dsh-tool-subagent/src/model-selection.ts L142-148 将显式选择限制为父级路由并报错，list-models.ts 同样只列父级路由。结果可达性核验：模型路由属宿主所有，内建工具、客户端能力、agent 自行构建的手段（bash/web）都无法在未授权会话内让委派子代理跑在其他路由上。角色文件本身是普通文件可读（setup-pstack 答案行已覆盖位置与格式），但按行传参撞同一授权门。上游依据示例：poteto-mode/SKILL.md L90 \"an explicit model per role, Project workers included\"；show-me-your-work L69 \"spawn a subagent on another vendor's model than the one that did the work\"。",
      "status": "proposed"
    },
    {
      "id": "subagent-interrupt",
      "description": "中断或取消一个正在运行的子代理。上游 Pause safely 手册要求在安全边界取消全部嵌套子代理后再暂停；标准模式的委派工具组把中断功能关闭，会话内没有任何手段能停止一个运行中的子代理，只能等它自行结束。",
      "sources": [
        "dsh.md",
        "dsh-evidence.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/playbooks/pause-safely.md"
      ],
      "evidence": "dsh-evidence.md resume 行：内置 preset 把 `tool-subagent-control` 的 `config.interrupt` 设为 `false`，模型拿不到 `interrupt_agent`。运行时核验：`dsh-web-app/presets/standard.patch.yml` 的 delegation 组对 `tool-subagent-control` 同样写明 `interrupt: false`，服务层中断 API 不对模型暴露。结果可达性核验：子代理运行于宿主进程内，内建工具与 agent 自行构建的手段都无法定向停止某一个子代理。上游依据：pause-safely.md L5 \"Start nothing new, and cancel any nested subagents.\"",
      "status": "proposed"
    },
    {
      "id": "subagent-readonly-sandbox",
      "description": "委派一个由运行时强制只读的子代理：不可写文件、不可驱动应用。上游把只读评审者、跨厂商评判、feature 调查者作为评审与维护流程的默认参与者，并要求其围栏由结构保证而非自觉遵守；标准模式的子代理没有沙箱参数，写入限制只有会话级三档预设，具备写权限的会话里任何子代理都能写文件、驱动应用，提示词约束与事后 git status 补查都不能阻止运行中的越权副作用。",
      "sources": [
        "dsh.md",
        "dsh-evidence.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/agents/comment-sicko.md",
        "pstack/skills/maintain-verification-skill/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/docs/guide/03-understand.md",
        "pstack/docs/guide/04-design.md",
        "pstack/docs/guide/05-build-and-clean.md"
      ],
      "evidence": "dsh-evidence.md readonly 行：`tool-subagent` 无 sandbox 参数，写入限制由会话级 `dsh-sandbox-policy` 与 `permission-presets` 决定；dsh.md readonly 行只给出提示词约束 + 会话权限 + 事后 `git status` 的近似路径。运行时核验：standard preset 的 `tool-subagent` 配置无沙箱字段；`dsh-base/cordis.patch.yml` 的 permission-presets 仅会话级 `read-only`/`workspace-write`/`danger-full-access` 三档；`dsh-tool-subagent/src/preset-selection.ts` 的 `agent_preset` 参数仅在部署配置显式给出 `allowedAgentPresets` 白名单时开放，standard 预设未配置，传入即报 \"agent_preset selection is disabled\"，子代理只能继承父级预设。结果可达性核验：会话级模式无法在同一个会话内混合可写主线程与只读子代理；提示词纪律不产生结构性围栏，也无法阻止子代理驱动应用产生的不可回滚副作用。上游依据示例：maintain-verification-skill L31 \"One read-only subagent per feature file... Children never drive the app and never edit files\"；comment-sicko L30 \"I never write application code.\"、L32 \"Report only.\"。",
      "status": "proposed"
    },
    {
      "id": "inline-video-playback",
      "description": "在回复中内嵌并直接播放视频，包括 /ketchup 汇总里的产物视频与 /ketchup-video 生成的成片。上游要求把截图和视频内嵌展示，而不只是链接；视频成片本身就是该技能的主要交付形态。DSH 标准客户端只把图片和 SVG 内嵌渲染，音频与视频显示为文件卡片，不能内联播放；agent 可以用 ffmpeg 等工具渲染 mp4，但无法改变客户端呈现形态。",
      "sources": [
        "pstack/skills/ketchup/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/skills/ketchup-video/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/docs/guide/02-poteto-mode.md",
        "pstack/docs/guide/04-design.md",
        "pstack/docs/guide/06-verify-and-ship.md",
        "pstack/docs/guide/10-recipes-and-pitfalls.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-help/references/prompting.md",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-help/references/recipes.md"
      ],
      "evidence": "DSH Web 客户端运行时核验：dsh-client-ui-attachment 的消息附件呈现只有 MessageImage/图片画廊，没有 video 元素；README FAQ 明确写 Native DSH renders images and SVG inline，audio or video shows as a file card。上游依据：ketchup/SKILL.md:43 \"Embed screenshots and videos inline when the change is visible, not only as links.\"；ketchup-video/SKILL.md:9 的回复是 \"the embedded video\"，第 27 行要求渲染 mp4 后再嵌入，第 29 行要求在嵌入前检查成片。",
      "status": "proposed"
    }
  ],
